---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="Terms for using wojciech.io: what the site offers, the newsletter, content ownership, and how to reach me."
  canonical="/terms/"
  noindex={true}
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-[var(--space-section)]">
    <h1 class="text-[length:var(--text-h1)] font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] mb-10">Last updated: July 2026</p>

    <div class="prose-custom space-y-8 text-[var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">1. Who runs this site</h2>
        <p>wojciech.io is operated by Wojciech Łuszczyński, a private individual, correspondence address: Torstraße 218, 10115 Berlin, Germany ("I", "me"). Reach me through the <a href="/contact/" class="text-[var(--color-accent-hi)] hover:underline">contact page</a> or <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/wojciechluszczynski/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--color-accent-hi)] hover:underline">LinkedIn ↗</a>.</p>
        <p class="mt-2">These terms cover the website and its free services: the content and the AI Espresso newsletter. Paid products, if any, carry their own terms at the point of purchase.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">2. What the site offers</h2>
        <p>Articles, case studies, tools, and notes on GTM, growth, and AI systems, plus a free email newsletter. Everything here is informational. Nothing on this site is legal, financial, or professional advice, and following it is at your own judgement.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">3. Using the site</h2>
        <p>Read it, share it, quote it with attribution. Do not:</p>
        <ul class="mt-2 ml-4 space-y-1 list-disc list-outside text-sm">
          <li>Republish full articles as your own</li>
          <li>Scrape the site to train models or resell the content</li>
          <li>Attempt to break, overload, or gain unauthorised access to any service</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm">You need a modern browser with JavaScript enabled. No account is required for the public site.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">4. The newsletter</h2>
        <p>Signing up is free and takes a double opt-in: you enter your email, tick the consent box, and confirm. I send operator notes on AI systems and GTM. No spam, no selling your address. Unsubscribe from any email or by writing to me, and you are off the list.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">5. Content and copyright</h2>
        <p>The text, code samples, graphics, and layout are mine unless credited otherwise. You may quote short excerpts with a link back. For anything more, ask first.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">6. Your data</h2>
        <p>How I handle data is in the <a href="/privacy/" class="text-[var(--color-accent-hi)] hover:underline">privacy policy</a>. Short version: consent-gated analytics, EU data residency, no ad networks, no selling data.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">7. Liability</h2>
        <p>The site is provided as is. I keep it accurate and online, but I do not guarantee it is error-free or always available. I am not liable for decisions you make based on the content, to the extent the law allows.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">8. Complaints</h2>
        <p>Something wrong, broken, or unclear? Write to me via the <a href="/contact/" class="text-[var(--color-accent-hi)] hover:underline">contact page</a>. I reply within 14 days.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">9. Changes and governing law</h2>
        <p>I may update these terms; the date at the top shows when. Material changes to the newsletter terms go out by email. Polish law applies, and nothing here limits your statutory consumer rights.</p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
